              "default": null,
              "description": "How to group turns into rounds.\n\"cycle\" (default) — a round ends when the anchor speaker (first\nspeaker seen) regains the floor after at least one other speaker\nhas spoken.\n\"pairs\" — every consecutive pair of turns is one round.",
              "is_optional": false,
              "type_name": "\"cycle\" | \"pairs\""
